  "extraction_notes": [
    "W1 and W2 are 24 h proxy-usage-analysis reports; every *_tokens, *_seconds and divert figure is copied from the named table in the report, not recomputed.",
    "W1.local_sessions is derived as sessions minus remote-only sessions because that report predates the explicit 'sessions with at least one local turn' line; W2 records it directly (175 of 620).",
    "W6 is a committed JSON artifact, so the contention figures do not depend on log retention.",
    "No figure in this file was produced by re-running the live proxy, flipping geometry, or contending for a slot: the analysis is desk-only per the parent work item's constraint."
  ]
